  <title class="- topic/title ">New Feature and Update</title> 
  <body class="- topic/body "> 
	 <draft-comment translate="no" class="- topic/draft-comment ">Converted using FMHtml2Dita version: 2.1.0 
	 </draft-comment> 
	 <p class="- topic/p "> Below is a list of features that have BIOS impact or BIOS requirements: 
	 </p> 
	  
	  
	  
	  
	 <p platform="NVL" class="- topic/p "> 
	 <ul id="UL_467D7085E7DB474AB7ED9290A9D117F8" class="- topic/ul "> 
		<li id="LI_B9DBAA3E7905433F9BE185B7DC0AF5E7" class="- topic/li "> Logical Processor Programming. For more details, refer to 
		  <xref scope="local" format="dita" href="GUID-8A9082BB-35CE-46E1-9260-F5408CD5658C.xml#GUID-8A9082BB-35CE-46E1-9260-F5408CD5658C" class="- topic/xref "></xref> and 
		  <xref scope="local" format="dita" href="GUID-D1F7343D-33AB-43AA-A0D0-34D239A9B825.xml#GUID-D1F7343D-33AB-43AA-A0D0-34D239A9B825" class="- topic/xref "></xref>. 
		</li> 
		<li id="LI_1DC713FCDBC9434E9FDE2525DE3CF3E0" class="- topic/li "> MTRR Configurations for 1 TB Memory. For more details, refer to 
		  <xref scope="local" format="dita" href="GUID-2A5D671C-9660-41C7-9F68-B8047FEDC052.xml#GUID-2A5D671C-9660-41C7-9F68-B8047FEDC052" class="- topic/xref "></xref>. 
		</li> 
		<li id="LI_5E8963E8BCE14B2CBEBDAE5B660F6537" class="- topic/li "> VR and Power Delivery. For more details, refer to 
		  <xref scope="local" format="dita" href="GUID-2A5D671C-9660-41C7-9F68-B8047FEDC052.xml#GUID-2A5D671C-9660-41C7-9F68-B8047FEDC052" class="- topic/xref "></xref>. 
		</li> 
		<li id="LI_D0B014A24653460B9E3EE08887D2C6D4" class="- topic/li ">EDKII provide an Dynamic PCD to modify BIOS default. Some options rarely changed by user in the Setup Menu will be moved to PCDs. 
		  <ul id="GUID-EB09C631-F5BD-48E3-9AF8-2A291EB1C3C3" class="- topic/ul "> 
			 <li id="LI_88925AB91CFE42408F2F6A31C12A3FF6" class="- topic/li ">AP Idle Manner --&gt; gUefiCpuPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdCpuApLoopMode 
			 </li> 
		  </ul> 
		</li>
		<li id="LI_016D444B2576496E842D36B7B11F9898" class="- topic/li ">For Razor Lake specific changes, refer to 
		  <xref scope="local" format="dita" href="GUID-14094841-6D14-4270-B56E-5142CA8A79A4.xml" class="- topic/xref ">Razor Lake Updates</xref>.
		</li> 
	 </ul> 
	 </p> 
